    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "tabini and nituke have a slight differense. In \"nituke\" after the pattern there come phrases expressing feelings/emotions or emotional patterns. So that the meaning of \"nituke\" - whenever someone happens to be in same situation, always has certain feelings and thus does something.",
      "html": "tabini and nituke have a slight differense. In \"nituke\" after the pattern there come phrases expressing feelings/emotions or emotional patterns. So that the meaning of \"nituke\" - whenever someone happens to be in same situation, always has certain feelings and thus does something.",
